                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0ad79f1-29b1-4fd3-8f23-0a12e3dee8c2",
                                "sense_id": "67c98b82-1e5f-39b1-a037-7d9d1a14ef66",
                                "text": "— Вас вообще волосы беспокоят, Семён Петрович, — заметила Марианна, — я уверена, что вы тоже не можете видеть равнодушно, если у кого они острижены, как у меня.",
                                "translation": "'Hair in general seems rather to worry you, Semyon Petrovitch,' observed Marianna; 'I am sure you can't look at any one with equanimity whose hair is cropped like mine.'",
                                "english": "'Hair in general seems rather to worry you, Semyon Petrovitch,' observed Marianna; 'I am sure you can't look at any one with equanimity whose hair is cropped like mine.'"
                            }
                        ]
